      "heroic_requirement": "",
      "implementation_note": "Automated: when an enemy makes you lose HP (its attack or skill damage, a damage tick from a status it applied, or an effect it runs that makes you lose HP and is recorded as an HP loss) you may pay max(5, 5 x Brainwave sections) MP: that enemy loses 5 + 5 x sections MP (+10 at level 20, +20 at level 40) and becomes Dazed or Shaken (your choice); 1 section fills. NOT automated: 'an enemy succeeds on an Opposed Check against you' (the engine emits no contest-outcome event; e.g. an Imp's Strip Armor / Strip Weapon). GM applies it by hand. Also not seen: an HP loss the engine does not record as an event (a plain cost-style HP debit), and HP loss whose cause is unattributed.",
